# Stage 2: V-TS1 seed optimization at GFN2-xTB (for V-I1 generation)
# Job ID: V-TS1-T1-V01 (optimized as a minimum first to see where it relaxes)
# Note: This is a MINIMUM optimization of the TS guess to get converged geometry
# that we can perturb for V-I1. The actual TS search comes in Stage 3.
! XTB2 OPT FREQ

%pal nprocs 1 end

* xyzfile 0 1 V-TS1_start.xyz
